        <details><summary>Is there a dive guide?</summary><p>Scheduled scuba expeditions include a certified divemaster and exclusive use of the landing craft. On a private charter you can add a divemaster for $500 per night or dive self guided.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How do tank fills work?</summary><p>Supernova carries an onboard dive compressor, so tanks are refilled right on the boat between dives.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do I bring my own gear?</summary><p>[CONFIRM: bring your own drysuit and gear, or is rental gear available?]</p></details>
        <details><summary>What if the weather turns?</summary><p>Captain Paul picks sites around tides, currents and weather every day. Plans change when conditions call for it, and safety always comes first.</p></details>
      </div>
